{"strongs": "H3039", "word": "יָדִיד", "translit": "ye.did", "root": "ידד", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "beloved", "definition": "[ יָדִיד ] adjective (poetry) beloved (Late Hebrew id. , Aramaic ) — construct יְדִיד Deut 33:12 suffix לִידִידִי Isa 5:1 (twice in verse); Jer 11:15 לִידִידוֺ Ps 127:2 plural suffix יְדִידֶיךָ Ps 60:7 ; Ps 108:7 feminine יְדִידֹת Ps 45:1 יְדִידוֺת Ps 84:2 — 1. my beloved , used by prophets of ׳ י under figure of husbandman Isa 5:1 (twice in verse); so my (thy, his) beloved Jer 11:15 ; Ps 60:7 = Ps 108:7 ; Ps 2 beloved , of Benjamin as beloved by ׳ י Deut 33:12 . 2. lovely , מַהיְּֿדִידוֺת מִשְׁכְּנוֺתֶיךָ Ps 84:2 how lovely are thy habitations ! 3. feminine plural as abstract substantive שִׁיר יְדִידֹת Ps 45:1 = a song of love .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3441')\">BDB3441</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3039')\">H3039</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3440')\">BDB3440</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3442')\">BDB3442</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>יָדִיד</bdbheb>] <b>adjective</b> (poetry) <highlightword>beloved</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>, Aramaic <placeholder2179/>) — construct <bdbheb>יְדִיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,12)\">Deut 33:12</ref> suffix <bdbheb>לִידִידִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,1)\">Isa 5:1</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 11:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,15)\">Jer 11:15</ref> <bdbheb>לִידִידוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 127:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"127\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"127\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,127,2)\">Ps 127:2</ref> plural suffix <bdbheb>יְדִידֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,7)\">Ps 60:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 108:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"108\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"108\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,108,7)\">Ps 108:7</ref> feminine <bdbheb>יְדִידֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,1)\">Ps 45:1</ref> <bdbheb>יְדִידוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 84:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"84\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"84\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,84,2)\">Ps 84:2</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>my beloved</highlight>, used by prophets of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> under figure of husbandman <ref ref=\"Isa 5:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,1)\">Isa 5:1</ref> (twice in verse); so <highlight>my</highlight> (thy, his) <highlight>beloved</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 11:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,15)\">Jer 11:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 60:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,7)\">Ps 60:7</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 108:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"108\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"108\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,108,7)\">Ps 108:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,1)\">Ps 2</ref> <highlight>beloved</highlight>, of Benjamin as beloved by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,12)\">Deut 33:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>lovely</highlight>, <bdbheb>מַהיְּֿדִידוֺת מִשְׁכְּנוֺתֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 84:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"84\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"84\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,84,2)\">Ps 84:2</ref> <highlight>how lovely are thy habitations !</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> feminine plural as abstract substantive <bdbheb>שִׁיר יְדִידֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,1)\">Ps 45:1</ref> = <highlight>a song of love</highlight>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 33:12", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 33, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 5:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jer 11:15", "book": "JER", "chapter": 11, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 127:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 127, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 60:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 60, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 108:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 108, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 45:1", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 45, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ps 84:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 84, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 1, "chapterEnd": 2, "verseEnd": 200}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["יָדִיד", "יְדִיד", "לִידִידִי", "לִידִידוֺ", "יְדִידֶיךָ", "יְדִידֹת", "יְדִידוֺת", "׳", "י", "מַהיְּֿדִידוֺת מִשְׁכְּנוֺתֶיךָ", "שִׁיר יְדִידֹת"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB3441", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}